                  ],
                  "answer": "D",
                  "explanation": "Of 80: males $=48$, females $=32$. Commerce males $=0.75\\times48=36$; commerce females $=25\\%\\times32=8$. Total commerce $=44$, i.e. $44/80=55\\%$.",
                  "images": [],
