                {
                  "number": 6,
                  "question_type": "problem-solving",
                  "stem": "6. Company PQR has 3 machines. Machine A take 5 minutes to produce the item, machine b takes 12 minutes to produce 2 and machine c takes 10 minutes to produce the item. If they run simultaneously how many hours will it take to produce 294 of the said item?",
                  "options": [
                    {
                      "label": "A",
                      "text": "10"
