                {
                  "number": 12,
                  "question_type": "problem-solving",
                  "stem": "12. Integer x when divided by y, quotient is 11 and remainder is 4, and x is divided by 16 quotient is 4 and remainder is y. Find the value of X.",
                  "options": [
                    {
                      "label": "A",
                      "text": "60"
