                      "text": "90"
                    },
                    {
                      "label": "E",
                      "text": "None of these"
                    }
                  ],
                  "answer": "B",
                  "explanation": "$x=11y+4$ and $x=16\\cdot4+y=64+y$. So $11y+4=64+y\\Rightarrow10y=60\\Rightarrow y=6$, and $x=70$ (remainders $4<6$ and $6<16$ are valid).",
                  "images": [],
