                  "number": 15,
                  "question_type": "problem-solving",
                  "stem": "15. In a picnic, a went P% at a rate 20km/hr and remaining at a rate of 30km/hr. What is his avg speed?",
                  "options": [
                    {
                      "label": "A",
                      "text": "$\\frac{6000}{p+200}$"
