                    {
                      "label": "B",
                      "text": "$\\frac{p+200}{6000}$"
                    },
                    {
                      "label": "C",
                      "text": "$\\frac{100-p}{30}$"
                    },
                    {
                      "label": "D",
                      "text": "$\\frac{6000}{p-200}$"
                    },
                    {
                      "label": "E",
                      "text": "None of these"
                    }
                  ],
                  "answer": "A",
                  "explanation": "For 100 units of distance, time $=\\frac{P}{20}+\\frac{100-P}{30}=\\frac{3P+2(100-P)}{60}=\\frac{P+200}{60}$. Average speed $=\\frac{100}{(P+200)/60}=\\frac{6000}{P+200}$.",
                  "images": [],
                  "needs_review": false
