                {
                  "number": 19,
                  "question_type": "problem-solving",
                  "stem": "19. Helen bought a ticket for $\\$$ 252. If she'd bought it 1 day later, she would have paid $\\$$306. How many days in advance did she buy her ticket?\nConference Ticket Advance Discounts: ♦ 5-29 days in advance 15%\n♦ 30-59 day in advance 30% ♦ 60-89 day in advance 40%",
